@startuml seq_sft_cold_oil
title SC-SFT-07 - Cold oil: 4th gear inhibited

actor "Console user" as User
participant "Console" as Console
participant "Plant model" as Plant
participant "TCU" as TCU

note over User, TCU
Covers: SYS-SFT-008, SYS-SFT-005, SYS-SFT-004, SYS-SEN-003, SIM-PLT-007, SIM-CON-003
CAN frames pass can0 / slcand / gateway transparently (DC-05, SIM-GW-001), see SC-STA-04.
Oil temperature from OilTempVoltage: T = (U - 500) x 190 / 4000 - 40 (can_matrix section 4, SYS-SEN-003).
end note

== start-up with cold oil ==
User -> Console : oil start temperature at or below -5 degC (example -7 degC, SYS-SFT-008 verification)
Console -> Plant : oil start value (SIM-PLT-007)
note over TCU: until the first SIM_Analog reception the substitute 80 degC applies\n(SYS-COM-002 note, can_matrix section 6)
Plant -> TCU : SIM_Analog: OilTempVoltage (-7 degC), first reception
TCU -> TCU : at start-up oil temperature <= -5 degC -> 4th inhibited (SYS-SFT-008)
note right of TCU: "at startup" = the first oil temperature received after reset,\nnot the substitute value 80 degC (SYS-SFT-008)
note over Plant, TCU: D, accelerating
TCU -> TCU : schedule gives 4th, inhibited -> 3rd kept, 4th not commanded
TCU -> Plant : TCU_Actuators: SS_A = OFF, SS_B = OFF (3rd)

== warm-up ==
Plant -> Plant : slow warm-up while driving (SIM-PLT-007)
Plant -> TCU : SIM_Analog: oil temperature above -5 degC
TCU -> TCU : inhibit released (SYS-SFT-008)
... >= 2000 ms after the previous shift (SYS-SFT-004) ...
TCU -> Plant : TCU_Actuators: SS_A = ON, SS_B = OFF (shift 3 -> 4)

== oil temperature falls below -10 degC in 4th ==
User -> Console : force OilTempVoltage (SIM-CON-003)
Plant -> TCU : SIM_Analog: oil temperature below -10 degC
TCU -> TCU : inhibit active while 4th is commanded -> downshift to 3rd (SYS-SFT-008)
alt prediction for 3rd <= 6000 rpm (SYS-SFT-005) and SYS-SFT-004 elapsed
  TCU -> Plant : TCU_Actuators: SS_A = OFF, SS_B = OFF (shift 4 -> 3)
  Plant -> Plant : ratio 0.70 -> 1.00 over 400 ms (SIM-PLT-003)
else prediction for 3rd > 6000 rpm
  TCU -> TCU : downshift refused, 4th kept (SYS-SFT-008 note: SYS-SFT-005 takes priority)
  TCU -> Plant : TCU_Actuators: SS_A = ON, SS_B = OFF (4th)
end
note over Plant, TCU: the inhibit is released again only above -5 degC (hysteresis -10 / -5 degC)
@enduml
